 "notes": [
  "Kit2 of the shipped van-der-palmkade-191-120309 (lane kit-batch-8504-20261121): the same east canal front (panel 216: group 0 surfaces 550 and 224, group 1 surface 290 in the same system so the per-bay render and accent panels reach both halves; w02-97 2021-01-14; the 13 m surface 380 behind the middle bay is left to the window grid as in the shipped recipe) with the kit gaps closed since: a cream render panel per bay round the first floor's window pairs (renderPanels), round-arched second-storey openings, the third storey's windows in pairs either side of a blue panel (windowGroup + accentPanels), the light attic as a render panel over its lower part, storey heights from the crop (storeyFactors).",
  "Not expressed: the open loggias behind the three left arches (the kit's loggias are square-headed, so the arches stay glazed), the white roundels in the brick over the arches, the white pier caps and pergola beams of the attic terrace.",
  "roof.flatHex / pitchedHex from the shipped recipe (PDOK orthophoto reading, roof-facts 14/8413/5383).",
  "Other walls: the rest of the S-shaped block (window grid); no other crop was archived."
 ]
